    "difficultyReason": "Both substitutions are given, so the student only rewrites x and dx in u. Part a needs x-1=u^2+1 and cancels u to reach an arctan. Part b needs x=(u^2-1)/2 and a small polynomial integral. This is about the same as p41-q13 but with simpler algebra.",
